message: "If you use this software or the associated analysis pipeline, please cite it as below."
title: "A falsification framework for causal claims in polygenic epidemiology: the insomnia–Alzheimer's disease test case"
abstract: "Analysis pipeline for a six-level falsification framework for Mendelian randomization-based causal claims, applied to insomnia–Alzheimer's disease comorbidity. Includes bidirectional MR, LDSC rg, coloc, two-step protein/metabolite mediation MR, MVMR, education PheWAS, East Asian cross-ancestry replication, and a 43,200-replicate simulation."
